        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Global GAL Series Grade 2 Standard  Commercial Door Levers</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe GAL standard design commercial levers are heavy duty Grade 2 with <b>Vandal Resistant</b> free wheeling Clutch mechanism. Available in a wide selection of functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nComplies with ANSI/BHMA A156.4, Series 4000, Grade 2. Listed by UL / ULC for ratings of \u001cA\u001d  label (3 hours) and less, UL10C / UBC 7-2 (1997) positive pressure, for single doors up to 4\u0019'0\"\u001d x 8'\u00190\".\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThese <a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><b>ADA compliant levers</b></a> (conform to A117.1 Barrier Free Accessibility Code) are solid cast and fully adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 1-7/8\" thick doors. They also conform to <b>California Code title 19</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Global GAL Series Commercial Levers:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 1-7/8\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Door Prep: Fits standard 161 door prep.</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Standard 2-3/4\", Optional 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Case: Steel, Zinc dichromated resists corrosion, heavy duty spring cage.</li>\r\n<li>Thru-bolted: 5/16\" holes outside 2-1/8\" bore for anti-rotation.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 4-7/8\" X 1-1/4\", curved lip (Standard ASA). </li>\r\n<li>Latchbolt: 5/8\" throw stainless steel 3 hour UL rated.</li>\r\n<li>Handing: Non-handed.</li>\r\n<li>Trim: \"L\" Eiffel levers.</li>\r\n<li>Keyways: SC1 \"C\" Standard (for keyed functions).</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder: Brass 6-pin cylinder keyed to 6-pins (for keyed functions).</li>\r\n<li>Vandal Resistant: Clutch free wheeling mechanism.</li>\r\n<li>Manufacturers Warranty: Lifetime Mechanical - 10 Year Finish</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Standard <b>Brushed Chrome</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim, one (1) side.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet)(ANSI# F75): </b>For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom)(ANSI# F76): </b>For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (ANSI# F109): </b>Outside lever locked and unlatched by key. Turn button locking inside.</li>\r\n<li><b>Classroom (ANSI# F84): </b>Outside lever locked and unlocked by key. Inside lever always unlocked.</li>\r\n<li><b>Storeroom (ANSI# F86): </b>Outside lever fixed. Entry by key only. Inside lever always unlocked. </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Standard Commercial Leversets, Global GAL Series",
                "description": "Global commercial door leversets that are heavy duty Grade 2  with Vandal Resistant free wheeling Clutch mechanism. Available in a wide selection of functions, ADA compliant levers (conform to A117.1 Barrier Free Accessibility Code) are solid cast and fully adjustable for 1-3/8  to 1-7/8 inch thick doors. They also conform to California Code title 19",
                "keywords": "GLO-GAL-xxxxL, Global GAL Series Grade 2 Commercial Leversets, global door commercial door levers, Standard  commercial door locks, ADA compliant door levers, Global door controls Grade 2 Commercial Door Levers, GLO-GAL-1110L-R-626 passage levers, GLO-GAL-1140L-R-626 privacy levers, GLO-GAL-1151L-R-626 entry levers, GLO-GAL-1170L-R-626 classroom levers, GLO-GAL-1180L-R-626 storeroom levers,"
